/-!
# Round six, item language (I3): `KFRAddr` for an arbitrary slot width `F`

Copies of the frozen `KFRLay`/`KFRAddr` row-geometry lemmas (stated there for `f = m ^ k`) for any
slot width `F ≥ 1` (`[NeZero F]`): `shR_volF`, `shR_weightF`, `encode_rowAddAddrF`.
